{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a6689b3544af059e6077f6a9b93d6c43499c5f9692b20ed9d590c493ca23457","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的审判和慈爱"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["以东人多益去告诉扫罗：“大卫到了亚希米勒家。”那时大卫作了这首训诲诗，交给乐长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"勇士啊，你为何以作恶为荣？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的慈爱永远长存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这诡诈的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舌头利如剃刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽是害人的奸计。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜爱邪恶，不爱良善；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜爱虚谎，不爱真理。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有诡诈的舌头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好说恶言恶语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝必永远毁灭你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必抓住你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你从家里拉出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从活人之地铲除。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"义人看见必心生敬畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必嘲笑说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，这就是不依靠上帝的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他只倚仗自己的财富并靠作恶得势。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我就像上帝殿中的一棵橄榄树，枝繁叶茂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我永永远远信靠上帝的慈爱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要永远赞美你的作为。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在你忠心的子民面前仰望你美善的名。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}